  "published": "2026-11-02T20:02:09.493Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.2: extraction diagnostics release. File-writing failures during extraction now log the real exception and return Chderrdecompressionerror for data/codec failures or Chderrwriteerror for output I/O instead of flattening every failure to Chderrwriteerror. Read-ahead teardown no longer races a disposed semaphore, and damaged GD-ROM metadata returns Chderrinvaliddata instead of throwing. No encoder output changes: the quick battle harness stays 3,174/3,174 checks byte-identical to chdman 0.289, and CD/GD-ROM extraction is verified byte-identical to chdman extractcd. No public API changes. Pure C# - zero native dependencies. Targets net8.0/net9.0/net10.0.",
